Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.20,0:00:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.50,0:00:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们夜里行军 黎明时分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We march at nightfall, and by dawn's light,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.43,0:00:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,就能抓到斯巴达克斯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}see an end to Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.46,0:00:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,有信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,葛雷博\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Glaber?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.37,0:00:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,再来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Again!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.81,0:00:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,撤进地道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fall back into the tunnel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.89,0:00:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,走 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Move, move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.41,0:00:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,走山路 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The mountain path, hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.85,0:00:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我们被包围了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We'll be trapped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.89,0:00:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,没办法了 我们必须走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's no choice. We must move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.63,0:00:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你打算放过他们吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will let them go free?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.09,0:00:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我要把他们赶尽杀绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, we shall kill them all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.87,0:00:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,《斯巴达克斯：复仇》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.04,0:00:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,《神谴》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.74,0:01:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,柴火快用完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The wood for fire is almost gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.31,0:01:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,吃的也不多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our food quickly follows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.34,0:01:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,自打葛雷博把我们逼到山里以来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have stripped the mountain of what little it had{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.05,0:01:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,能找到的东西就这么点了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}ever since Glaber forced us upon it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.78,0:01:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不该发生这样的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A thing that should not have happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.80,0:01:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定能想到办法摆脱困境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will find a way to see us from this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.84,0:01:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你总能想到办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You always do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.12,0:01:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,而在我丧失信心的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As you always find words,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.81,0:01:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你的话总是能鼓励我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to pull me from darkest thoughts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.86,0:01:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,希望你的新欢也有这个本事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A talent I pray your next woman holds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.08,0:01:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.15,0:02:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,纳美特斯人和一群傻子出动了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nemetes and a clutch of fools have taken a foot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.32,0:02:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,去干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Towards what purpose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.37,0:02:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他们要冲到山下杀出罗马人的重围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They attempt to breach the Romans at the foot of the path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.32,0:02:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,下次打个招呼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give word next time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.79,0:02:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,还以为你是敌人呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Be mistaken as enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.85,0:02:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,葛雷博找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Glaber summons you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.59,0:02:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们刚吃完世界上最好吃的羊肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We only just finished dining on the most succulent lamb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.79,0:02:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定还剩了点肉渣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There may yet be few scraps left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.04,0:02:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,说话别太过分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You overstep,...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.55,0:02:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,奴隶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.57,0:02:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是听民政官差遣办事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I but place foot where our praetor commands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.06,0:02:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是有意见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you do not care for where it falls, ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.26,0:02:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管提出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you are free to take issue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.70,0:03:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,操你妈 你个混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.69,0:03:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我听不懂你说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do not know your tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.73,0:03:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,也没有学的打算\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nor have cause to learn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.03,0:03:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,撤退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pull back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.46,0:03:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.46,0:04:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.41,0:04:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,米拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mira!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.84,0:04:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得赶紧撤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.76,0:05:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,米拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mira!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.45,0:05:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得给她止血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must seal her wound!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.12,0:05:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,纳西尔 用火把你的剑烧热\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nasir! Heat your sword in the fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.61,0:05:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Quickly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.05,0:05:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.00,0:06:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得值得吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was it worth it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.73,0:06:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,值得赔上她的性命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was it worth... her life,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.98,0:06:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,来救你们几个吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to make attempt to save your own?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.98,0:06:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,别他妈跟着掺和\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stay your fucking ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.77,0:06:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,她死了都是因为你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She is gone from this world cause of you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.43,0:06:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,是你这个王八蛋把我们带到死路上的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are the mad fuck that led us to our deaths!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.37,0:06:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,最起码她堂堂正正死在战场上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At least she claimed hers as a warrior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.12,0:06:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,而不像我们一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not starving and robbed of strength,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.51,0:06:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,早晚在这儿饿死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as the rest of us are doomed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.60,0:06:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你说的对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.22,0:06:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们面前确实是死路一条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We will all perish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.15,0:07:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们不能同心协力的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If we do not stand together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.91,0:07:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈说这些废话有屁用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It will make no fucking difference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.70,0:07:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴 竖起你的狗耳朵好好听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seize tongue, and open fucking ears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.29,0:07:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,维苏威的悬崖上根本无路可走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The cliffs of Vesuvius are impassable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.89,0:07:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,只有往南才有一线生机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The southern path holds the only promise of making purchase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.50,0:07:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们占领了制高点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We hold the higher ground,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.11,0:07:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,正好可以弥补人数的不足\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and with it advantage over superior numbers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.54,0:07:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好像葛雷博真会傻到来攻打似的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Only if Glaber is foolish enough to attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.11,0:07:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不等他来 我们就都饿得没力气了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Before we are too weak from hunger to fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.03,0:07:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,饥饿和伤痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A man is never too weak...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.71,0:07:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,永远不是畏战的借口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or too wounded to fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.72,0:07:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,生命诚可贵 自由价更高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If the cause is greater than his own life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.31,0:07:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,葛雷博的大军迟早会来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Glaber and his army will come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.20,0:07:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,等他们来的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And when they do,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.73,0:07:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,就准备迎接复仇的怒火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Vesuvius will be forever stained...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.82,0:07:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,血染维苏威\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with the blood of vengeance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.89,0:08:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,就抓住他一个吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is all that was captured?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.36,0:08:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,还有几个死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Several more lay dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.04,0:08:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,活着算你走运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A fortunate thing you are not among them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.23,0:08:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,要不是我跟埃及人在场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Had that Egyptian and I not been present,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.47,0:08:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,据点就失守了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fear position would have been overrun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.41,0:08:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,看来是诸神保佑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The gods favor us then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.90,0:08:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不再庇护那些伤害我们的人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And turn from those who would do us harm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.69,0:08:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我说说斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell me of Spartacus,...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.62,0:08:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他对即将到来的暴风雨有什么想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and his thoughts toward coming storm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.31,0:08:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你个罗马败类也就配舔老子的屁股
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.14,0:08:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他会说人话吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can he form proper words?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.78,0:08:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,目前看好像不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has yet to break them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.95,0:08:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,看老子不在你头上撒泡尿
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.45,0:08:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,果真一句人话都不会说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A most unpleasant tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.87,0:09:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,形势一定很严峻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Conditions must be dire,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.31,0:09:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他们才会冒险下山 放弃制高点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to abandon the higher ground and attempt at such foolish act.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.83,0:09:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不过好像不是斯巴达克斯指挥的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One that did not appear commanded by Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.49,0:09:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你亲眼看见他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You laid eyes upon the man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.04,0:09:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,一眼而已 他和那帮杂碎救走了其余的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Briefly, as he and his... shits gave opportunities for others to retreat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.04,0:09:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他看起来怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How did he appear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.08,0:09:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,要命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Deadly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.67,0:09:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到他的眼神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet there was a look about eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.71,0:09:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,就像一只狂野的猛兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One found reflected in wild beast,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.61,0:09:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,在做困兽之斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when pressed to corner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.10,0:09:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这头畜生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Such an animal...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.09,0:09:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不见棺材不掉泪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}never greets the afterlife absent desperate blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.46,0:09:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,维苏威火山可不是百宝箱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Vesuvius is not Cere's Horn,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.28,0:09:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,可以取之不尽用之不竭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}offering endless bounty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.80,0:09:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那寸草不生的荒山上 根本没有什么可吃的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There cannot be much in way of nourishment left upon barren peak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.36,0:09:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就等一阵子再动手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We shall stay our hand yet a while longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.37,0:09:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,等他们饥寒交迫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And when hunger and despair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.08,0:09:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,奄奄一息的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}are the only tastes upon his lips,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.01,0:09:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯必将跪倒在罗马脚下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus shall kneel before Rome...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.42,0:09:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,永不翻身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for e final time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.81,0:10:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不应该上路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We should not be upon road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.22,0:10:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,回去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us turn back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.56,0:10:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.22,0:10:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我不愿意每天无所事事地待在卡普亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will not sit idle in Capua as weeks threaten unwelcome months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.96,0:10:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,很快就能等到头了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All will soon come to an end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.75,0:10:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经等不及了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would see the day hastened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.06,0:10:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我要让孩子出生在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And my child born in a city{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.65,0:10:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,民政官之子应该出生的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}befitting the heir of a praetor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.57,0:10:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你马上就要临产了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The glorious occasion is almost upon us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.61,0:10:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这时候冒险去罗马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To risk the journey to Rome...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.15,0:10:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,还有时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There was yet time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.07,0:10:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,只要我说服丈夫加快进攻的步伐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If my husband is moved to bring siege against Spartacus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.48,0:10:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,早点结束此事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to early conclusion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.46,0:10:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们才去维苏威\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The reason we are for Vesuvius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.02,0:10:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,一部分原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A fraction of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.13,0:10:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,其实我还有更加迫切的需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The whole of the truth encompassing greater need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.27,0:10:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说他的心已经回到你身上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Has heart returned so fiercely in such regard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.55,0:11:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,盖尤斯和我是一条心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gaius and I share but one now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.38,0:11:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他不在身边就感觉少了什么东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His absence leaving chest but half filled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.02,0:11:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,能够重新回到夫君的怀抱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To find yourself in the arms of a husband thought lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.76,0:11:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,真是天大的福气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's a blessing beyond measure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.85,0:11:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么会忘了最好的朋友呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A happiness I would share with a treasured friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.71,0:11:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我会带你去罗马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will come with me to Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.15,0:11:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,让盖尤斯给你准备一笔可观的嫁妆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will entreat Gaius towards dowry in honor of your service,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.45,0:11:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,然后你再找一位如意郎君相伴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and you shall again find comfort in title of wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.50,0:11:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你丈夫是不会让我陪你去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your husband would not have me follow with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.52,0:11:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你对他的帮助那么大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have been invaluable to his cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.64,0:11:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他看重的是另一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He believes another more so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.14,0:11:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他答应把我送给阿舒尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have been promised to Ashur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.60,0:11:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,阿舒尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ashur?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.55,0:11:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你丈夫为奖励他的犬马之劳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My hand and house, in payment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.17,0:11:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,把我和这间宅子一并赏给他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for blood spilled in your husband's name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.01,0:11:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么不早跟我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why have you not told me this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.79,0:11:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你产期将近 我不愿意跟你说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not have such thoughts weigh mind and body,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.99,0:12:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这么沉重的话题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with your day so close at hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.97,0:12:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我打算在维苏威\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will seize opportunity at Vesuvius,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.81,0:12:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,解除掉后顾之忧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and attempt to rid myself of burden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.14,0:12:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,说出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Reveal intentions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.57,0:12:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我帮你办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And see them embraced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.15,0:12:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们坐在这儿等死 他却在摆弄那些杂草\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We sit here waiting to die, and he tends to fucking weeds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.61,0:12:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他那是太伤心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He tends to his heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.92,0:12:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,人之常情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As any man should.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.55,0:12:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这里没有足够的柴火给她火葬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is not enough wood to build a pyre.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.31,0:12:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,土地又太硬 不能安葬她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The ground is too hard to lay her beneath it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.57,0:13:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他只能伤心地用斗篷给她裹尸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He can only grieve, and bind her in his cloak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.38,0:13:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那敢情好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A blessing then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.79,0:13:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不等她腐烂我们就全死翘翘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That we shall all be dead before she turns overly ripe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.84,0:13:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,纳美特斯人他们越来越不安了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nemetes and his kind grow ever more restless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.52,0:13:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕不光他们这么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fear they're not alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.23,0:13:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不怪他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I cannot lay blame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.51,0:13:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们唯一的机会就是在战术上击溃对手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet our only chance of survival is to hold fast to sound tactic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.47,0:13:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,就像上次区区几个人偷袭竞技场吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Like attacking the arena with a handful of men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.46,0:13:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前觉得你是一介莽夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I once thought you reckless fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.66,0:13:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我知道了 你之所以还没挂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now I see bold strategy is the only reason{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.95,0:13:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,全凭你有勇有谋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you're not already dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.55,0:13:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那是运气好 抓住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have been but fortunate, to have{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.50,0:13:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,罗马人完全想不到的那种机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}seized opportunity the Romans would consider mad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.18,0:13:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这次我们没有机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There stand none left to us now,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.57,0:14:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,除非长翅膀飞出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}absent wings to fly from cliff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.07,0:14:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我们和葛雷博的军队正面决战的那一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The day comes when we must face Glaber and his army{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.28,0:14:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,就要到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in open battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.07,0:14:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,就算死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If I am to die,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.80,0:14:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,至少有兄弟们陪着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}at least I shall die among brothers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.77,0:14:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们算是兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We share a bond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.49,0:14:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不是角斗士那种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Forged not upon the sands,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.95,0:14:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,但在战场里摸爬滚打过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but upon grander stage of battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.67,0:14:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,等事情完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And when it ends,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.50,0:14:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,作为犒赏 巴蒂塔斯的训练场和宅子归我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will gain Batiatus's ludus and villa as reward for loyal service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.33,0:15:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候在阿舒尔家族里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It will become the noble House of Ashur,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.05,0:15:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,要训练出整个共和国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}where I shall train the mightiest gladiators{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.93,0:15:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,最强的角斗士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in all the Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.05,0:15:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你们就是我的第一批战将\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would count you among my first recruits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.00,0:15:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你们发誓 保证…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I ask but for your oath, pledging{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.48,0:15:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,打开大门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Open the gate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.18,0:15:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,在这儿等着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wait here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.64,0:15:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,保证免除你的后顾之忧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And see weighted heart lifted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.83,0:15:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,再没动静了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There has been no further movement?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.93,0:15:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯已经知道突围只是徒劳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have taught Spartacus the futility of attempting breach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.26,0:15:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,让疯狗不露牙齿是不现实的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You cannot school rabid dog not to bare teeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.18,0:15:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,伊莉西娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ilithyia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.18,0:16:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你不该来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You should not have come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.03,0:16:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 规矩嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, I know, the rules.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.49,0:16:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,女人不能来营地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Women are forbidden in the encampment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.46,0:16:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是担心你和你肚子里的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My concern is only for you, and the life you carry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.23,0:16:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想让你这样子奔波劳累\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not have you travel in such condition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.23,0:16:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉好极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have never felt stronger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.41,0:16:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,再远的路程都没问题呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And would...travel a greater distance still.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.67,0:16:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你想回罗马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You wish to return to Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.63,0:16:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我夫君一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With my husband beside me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.22,0:16:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,叛徒们开始绝望了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The rebels become desperate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.61,0:16:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,再过几周 等他们饿得半死…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A few more weeks from starvation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.68,0:16:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,再过几周 你的继承人就会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A few more weeks and your heir will be born{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.16,0:16:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,在满是血迹和屎尿的地方出生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in a house tainted with blood and shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.96,0:16:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,杀掉斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}End Spartacus's life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.69,0:16:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我们一起回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And let us return home to ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.04,0:16:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,他占据了高地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He holds the higher ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.26,0:16:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,现在要拿下他们 我们势必伤亡惨重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It cannot be taken yet without severe loss of men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.52,0:17:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.49,0:17:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,可以拿下他们吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it can be taken?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.46,0:17:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,回卡普亚等我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Await me in Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.37,0:17:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,准备庆祝我们的孩子降生在…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And prepare to celebrate the birth of our child...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.87,0:17:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,罗马母亲的怀抱里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the arms of mother Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.72,0:17:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是威风凛凛 顶天立地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You truly stand a titan, threatening the very heavens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.12,0:17:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.13,0:17:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,记得我心里有你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And know that you are in my thoughts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.78,0:17:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,还有件事要告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would linger but a moment longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.63,0:17:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.49,0:17:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,警示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A warning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.18,0:17:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,诸神的警示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}From the gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.56,0:18:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么拿到这个的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How did this come to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.14,0:18:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我在清理赛皮娅的痕迹时发现的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I uncovered it while cleansing trace of Seppia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.23,0:18:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,就藏在她的物品里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Secreted among her things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.41,0:18:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我的奴隶阿玛纳看到有人给她这个东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My slave Amana recalls seeing it pressed into Seppia's hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.78,0:18:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那个叙利亚混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By the Syrian toad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.09,0:18:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,所以她知道哥哥死在你手里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is how she knew her brother's true fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.35,0:18:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,所以她要杀你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And why she moved against you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.77,0:18:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,没道理啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But it holds no sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.13,0:18:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,阿舒尔的命运握在我的手里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ashur's fortunes are tethered to my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.18,0:18:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他是条毒蛇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is a serpent,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.67,0:18:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,一刻不停地觊觎权力和地位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}forever seeking the heat of power and position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.77,0:18:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,当瓦里留斯危及你的地位时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When yours was threatened by Varinius,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.58,0:18:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他倒戈一击 卖主求荣 不算奇怪吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is it a wonder he sought to slither towards warmer clime?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.85,0:18:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他终究是卑鄙小人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A venomous creature to the last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.21,0:18:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙没什么价值了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One no longer holding worth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.46,0:18:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一个家伙也没有价值了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is not alone, in such regard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.56,0:18:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,毒蛇也好 神使也罢 如今不需要他们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Serpents and oracle have both served purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.00,0:19:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说露迪雅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You speak of Lucretia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.63,0:19:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我说的是一个知道很多秘密的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I speak of a woman who knows secrets I would not have revealed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.61,0:19:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你要我动手办这件事吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You would ask me to do such a thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.80,0:19:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想要那些不幸成为过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would put unfortunate past behind us,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.73,0:19:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们共迎美好的未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and seize glorious future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.80,0:20:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,真想念你的香味啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have missed your delicate scent...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.55,0:20:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,还有那些让我特别兴奋的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}among other offerings of more personal nature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.36,0:20:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,看到你来了 我真是高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It lifts spirits, to find you close again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.69,0:20:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我一会儿就走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I stay but a moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.97,0:20:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,无关紧要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A thing of low importance,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.36,0:20:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,反正我们还有一辈子的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when set against the promise of a lifetime{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.26,0:20:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,可以相互依偎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}held in loving embrace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.02,0:20:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,分手的时候不用难过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Will not shed tear when we part.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.44,0:20:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,要知道这场战斗很快就要结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Know that campaign soon draws to inevitable close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.26,0:20:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我阿舒尔就要上位了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And Ashur to deserving reward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.73,0:21:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,万分期待那一天的到来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I long to greet the day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.46,0:21:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,叙利亚人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Syrian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.69,0:21:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为我傻吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you think me the fool?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.76,0:21:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Praetor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.82,0:21:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do not understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.30,0:21:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是你拿的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you deny taking it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.20,0:21:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我从死人身上拿过很多东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I take many things from the fallen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.49,0:21:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这都是托您的福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought I had your blessing to do so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.26,0:21:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你还去找过赛皮娅托福吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And did you also seek Seppia's blessing,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.09,0:21:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,所以她企图刺杀我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}before she made attempt on my life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.43,0:21:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,赛皮娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seppia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.78,0:22:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我从未跟那姑娘说过话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've never broken words with the girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.75,0:22:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我听够了毒蛇的谎言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have had my fill of serpent's tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.39,0:22:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.02,0:22:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.26,0:22:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道别人跟您说了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do not know what you have been told,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.20,0:22:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不过恐怕您犯了严重的错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but I fear you have made a grave error.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.90,0:22:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕犯错的人是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now I fear you have made the error.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.26,0:22:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不知天高地厚 跟你的主子作对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In attempting to maneuver beyond your station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.28,0:22:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,可惜这么好的合作 落得如此结局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Unfortunate end to profitable association.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.89,0:22:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不如我带着他们就此离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps it best my men and I quietly take leave,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.35,0:22:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,以免伤了和气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}absent further disagreement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.49,0:22:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我有更好的提议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh I would make better offer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.16,0:22:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,只要愿意效忠于我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Land and a thousand denarii to each of you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.16,0:22:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,每人赐土地和一千第纳尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in return for faithful service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.12,0:23:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你们这些贱货\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You fucking cunts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.98,0:23:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,且慢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.72,0:23:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你曾对我宣誓效忠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You once swore to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.52,0:23:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,说什么"任您吩咐"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Your will, my hands.."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.90,0:23:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我的誓言从未动摇过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An oath that has not wavered!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.27,0:23:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我对您发誓 民政官大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I swear it to you, praetor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.07,0:23:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就试试你这些鬼话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would test such vaunted words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.32,0:23:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,还有你的忠诚是真是假\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the depths of your loyalty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.62,0:24:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.72,0:24:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,山路上有动静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's movement upon the path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.08,0:24:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,就位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take position!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.32,0:25:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,阿舒尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ashur!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.18,0:25:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我是替葛雷博传话来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I come bearing message from Glaber!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.29,0:25:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Speak it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.99,0:25:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他已经厌倦了这种对峙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has grown weary of this conflict.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.83,0:25:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,想赶回罗马让孩子顺利降生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And would return home to see his child born in Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.19,0:25:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,关我屁事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A thing of no interest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.49,0:25:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,可能关系到你们的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps the lives of your people hold more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.41,0:25:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他提出了投降条件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He offers terms of surrender.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.53,0:25:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,放下武器 就饶你们不死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lay down your arms, you'll be allowed to live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.11,0:25:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们做奴隶吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As slaves?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.89,0:25:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,跪在共和国的脚下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Beneath the heel of the Republic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.05,0:25:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 做奴隶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, as slaves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.61,0:25:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,但你们能活命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet you will have your lives!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.24,0:26:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,如果拒绝 葛雷博发誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Refuse, and Glaber has sworn torturous death{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.82,0:26:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,攻下山头后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}upon the cross for all{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.86,0:26:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,就把你们活生生钉死在十字架上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that survives the taking of the mountain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.33,0:26:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那斯巴达克斯的性命呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what of Spartacus's life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.99,0:26:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,作为交易的筹码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The cost of the bargain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.68,0:26:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我今天可不想死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I for one do not wish to die this day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.95,0:26:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不过相比这么窝囊地活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet if it is to be fucking so,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.98,0:26:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我宁愿自由地死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall do it as a free man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.19,0:26:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,狗日的罗马人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fuck the Romans!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.86,0:26:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,坚决不投降\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No surrender!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.63,0:26:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,叙利亚杂种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Syrian cunt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.62,0:26:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你听到答案了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have your answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.61,0:26:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Very well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.35,0:27:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我会把话原封不动地带给他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall deliver it to waiting ears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.69,0:27:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你先别急着走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not have us part so quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.26,0:27:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,葛雷博等着我 我必须\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Glaber awaits, I must return{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.84,0:27:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,给他答复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with a reply.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.40,0:27:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你的项上人头同样能答复他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your head would serve equal purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.71,0:27:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.91,0:27:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,他说的合情合理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I find no fault with his reasoning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.38,0:27:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,威猛的克雷斯 名垂千古的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The mighty Crixus, forever intoning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.34,0:27:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,伟大的角斗士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of the honor of a gladiator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.60,0:27:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,现在不顾体面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where stands such now,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.77,0:27:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,要欺负一个手无寸铁的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the cutting down of a defenseless man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.35,0:28:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,给他一把剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give him a sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.29,0:28:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你以前渴望能上场角斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You once dreamt of honor upon the sand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.11,0:28:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这就算你的最后一战吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Make this your final arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.51,0:28:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你贵为冠军 而我伤势严重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You stand a champion, and I gravely wounded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.22,0:28:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这场战斗毫无荣誉可言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is yet no honor in such contest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.64,0:28:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,去他妈的荣誉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To shit with honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.65,0:28:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.11,0:28:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我不要你玷污名誉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will not have you soil name,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.11,0:28:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,来为我报仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to gain vengeance in mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.19,0:28:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,妮维雅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Naevia...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.08,0:28:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我自己解决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall take it myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.22,0:28:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,阿舒尔对我的伤害无人可比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No one has been more wronged by Ashur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.40,0:28:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人比我更有资格取他的狗命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And no one has greater claim on his fucking life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.18,0:28:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我要亲手送他上西天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will see him fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.97,0:28:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,连同那段黑暗的回忆一并消灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And with him memories that haunt darkest nights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.18,0:29:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,交给你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See it done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.15,0:29:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定让她上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you certain of this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.16,0:29:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我听她的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am far removed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.66,0:29:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.13,0:29:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,如果今天阿舒尔必死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If Ashur must die today,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.08,0:29:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,起码要先送克雷斯的婊子下地狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}at least he will see Crixus's bitch to the afterlife before him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.65,0:29:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,砍下他的脑袋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take his fucking head off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.71,0:30:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,娇嫩的花朵长出刺来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Delicate flower has grown thorns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.75,0:30:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以打败他 妮维雅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You can take him, Naevia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.25,0:30:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,杀掉这个畜生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kill the cunt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.31,0:30:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不败的高卢人亲手磨砺的尖刺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sharpened by the undefeated Gaul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.07,0:30:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕没什么用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fear it will not help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.02,0:31:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,花朵凋谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She fades.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.28,0:31:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,一切美丽的东西都不可避免\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As all beautiful things do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.60,0:31:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,妮维雅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Naevia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.51,0:31:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,别出手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.24,0:31:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我的对手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.64,0:31:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stay back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.33,0:31:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我要让他为自己的罪行付出代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will have his life for what he did to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.65,0:32:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,死不足惜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or die in attempt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.57,0:32:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,上啊 加把劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.39,0:32:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你还记得吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you recall this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.80,0:32:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我紧紧压着你的胴体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My body pressed against yours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.74,0:32:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你没用地颤抖着 跟现在一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You trembling helpless, as you tremble now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.47,0:32:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,谁说我没用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am far from helpless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.51,0:33:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得这样做有改变吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You think this makes difference?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.97,0:33:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我的死不会愈合你的伤口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My death will not heal the scars you bear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.85,0:33:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,也不会抹去你被我玩弄的回忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nor erase memory of my cock inside of her,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.14,0:33:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,还有无数人的奸淫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or all those that followed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.99,0:33:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.04,0:33:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我忘不掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It will not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.55,0:33:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这只是一个开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But it is a fucking start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.29,0:34:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你说的对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You were right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.29,0:34:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,确实不容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is no easy task.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.65,0:34:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,一剑把人的脑袋砍下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To cleave a man's head from his shoulders in a single blow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.87,0:34:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那我来教你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then I will teach you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.51,0:34:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,多纳 莱顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Donar! Lydon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.87,0:35:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,把阿舒尔的脑袋放到路上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See Ashur's head upon the path,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.40,0:35:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,当作给葛雷博的回应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as reply to Glaber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.94,0:35:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你这回应真够明确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You send a clear one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.92,0:35:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,活着的人要钉死在十字架上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It will be nail and cross for those who live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.84,0:35:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,葛雷博肯定会这样对待我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Glaber would have seen us all to such fate,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.37,0:35:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不管我们作何回应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}regardless of answer carried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.88,0:35:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,就是说我们横竖都得死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So we are dead either way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.99,0:35:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,可惜没那么多树藤给我们的尸体用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pity there are not enough vines for all our corpses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.06,0:35:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,闭上你们的鸟嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Close fucking mouth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.64,0:35:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不 纳美特斯人说的对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. Nemetes is right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.21,0:35:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,树藤确实不够我们所有人用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There are not enough vines for us all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.01,0:35:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,但对几个人来说 还是绰绰有余\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And perhaps there's enough for a few.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.86,0:35:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你这话什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your words carry no meaning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.00,0:35:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,在葛雷博看来 正常的军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Glaber expects us to defend the higher ground,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.44,0:35:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,应该扼守高地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as any reasonable leader would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.11,0:35:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我们可以另辟蹊径\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet perhaps there is another course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.87,0:35:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,一步险棋 罗马人绝对想不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A bold one, that the Romans will never see coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.80,0:36:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,民政官大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Praetor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.04,0:36:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他们已经给出了回应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They have given reply.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.16,0:36:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯果然这么做了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus makes expected choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.73,0:36:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,传令下去 让全军吃好睡好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell the men to eat well and gather sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.52,0:36:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,黎明伊始 我们就要拿下维苏威\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dawn's first light we take Vesuvius{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.81,0:36:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,杀光所有胆敢藐视罗马的逆贼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the lives of all those who stand in defiance of Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.57,0:37:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就要离开这里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Soon we shall leave this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.48,0:37:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,再也不回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Never to return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.27,0:37:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你对我的友情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What your friendship brings me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.60,0:37:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,难以用语言表达我的感激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}there are no words to express gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.44,0:37:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经回报了许多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have returned the favor many times over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.97,0:37:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你的恩情我根本无法报答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The debt I owe far exceeds modest repayment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.10,0:37:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,是你把我从疯狂的边缘拉了回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You drew me from the depth of madness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.27,0:38:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,是你给了我力量和信念\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You gave me strength and purpose{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.01,0:38:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我才能走出那场惨剧的阴影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to live beyond the tragedy which betided this house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.40,0:38:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,过去的已经过去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Such things are of the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.90,0:38:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不要再为那些事伤心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let them give you no further pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.72,0:38:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我也尝试过不去想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have tried to put it from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.80,0:38:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,可那些痛苦的记忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The memory of all I have lost,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.52,0:38:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,仍弥漫在空气中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it fills the very air,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.69,0:38:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,每次呼吸都能感到刺痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}choking each breath with the sting of loss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.88,0:38:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,牢牢地束缚我的心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And binding my heart in chains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.61,0:38:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你就快解脱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You stand upon precipice of release.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.50,0:38:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.82,0:38:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我的救星 伊莉西娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're my savior, Ilithyia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.49,0:38:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你也是我的救星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.47,0:38:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你给了我生活的希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have given me hope of a life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.24,0:39:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,丈夫死时我以为一切都结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought denied me when my husband fell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.47,0:39:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,如此贵重的礼物应该永远珍藏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Know that such a gift shall be eternally treasured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.49,0:39:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.50,0:39:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,马上就要生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It comes too soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.30,0:39:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这是诸神的旨意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is a sign from the gods!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.78,0:39:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你的孩子必须在里面出生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It must be born within these walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.14,0:39:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.37,0:39:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们实现诸神的意志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us see their will be done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.27,0:39:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经用上了所有能找到的树藤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have used every vine we could gather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.34,0:39:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,够四个人下山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Enough for four men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.36,0:40:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力冈 克雷斯 甘尼克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Agron. Crixus. Gannicus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.66,0:40:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你们一起行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would have you by my side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.84,0:40:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,克雷斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.10,0:40:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们很快就能重聚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We will be reunited soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.45,0:40:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,无论今生 还是来世\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In this life, or the next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.32,0:40:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你们胸怀恐惧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know fear wells within your breast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.96,0:40:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这种想法很正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And it does so with great cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.21,0:40:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,罗马军队的人数远远超过我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Romans hold numbers far outweighing our own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.79,0:40:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,但他们一次次地暴露出致命的弱点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet they have revealed time and again fatal flaw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.18,0:41:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,即他们相信打仗只有用罗马人的方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That they believe the Roman way is the only one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.77,0:41:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,正如他们相信离开这座山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just as they believe that there is only one way{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.12,0:41:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,只有一条路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to leave this mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.09,0:41:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去教教他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We shall teach them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.18,0:41:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,路是可以亲手开辟的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that we forge our own paths.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.72,0:41:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,只要有决心和信念\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And nothing in this world is impossible,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.19,0:41:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,世上没有不可能的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when heart and mind are put towards it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.85,0:41:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,拉绳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Brace rope,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.12,0:41:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这一堂课要教他们永生难忘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}let us begin a lesson forever remembered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.78,0:41:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,雷声可以掩护这次行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The sound will mask descent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.12,0:41:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,诸神赐给我们大好良机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The gods bless us with good fortune.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.80,0:41:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,自由人自己创造机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Free men create their own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.92,0:42:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,今夜我们就是神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are all gods this night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.38,0:42:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,让罗马人感受到众神的愤怒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the Romans shall feel our wrath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.78,0:43:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.00,0:43:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,大家准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Prepare yourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.43,0:43:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,看到信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When signal comes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.43,0:43:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,就要玩命了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}death shall quickly follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.96,0:44:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得快点行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must move quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.91,0:44:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,别等他们发现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Before deed is discovered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.81,0:44:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,时辰已晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The hour is late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.46,0:44:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,睡不着了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sleep will not come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.58,0:44:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,只要我一闭眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All I see when eyes close{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.24,0:44:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,就看到斯巴达克斯的下场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is the end of Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.66,0:44:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我因为此事离开罗马这么久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And with him reason for being so long absent from Rome,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.49,0:44:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,还有很多重要的事情等着做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and more important matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.13,0:44:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,瓦里留斯失败了 而您凯旋而归\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will be victorious, where Varinius failed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.81,0:44:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这是您在元老院的资本\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A great advantage within the Senate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.47,0:44:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,借此平步青云\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To be used towards elevation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.77,0:44:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,总有一天 我要置身于万人之上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One day I shall rise above all others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.25,0:45:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,以如此辉煌的成就\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The light of accomplishment giving warmth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.82,0:45:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,荫庇我的爱妻和爱子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to loving wife and cherished heir...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.72,0:45:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,发警报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Raise alarm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.80,0:45:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,遵命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Praetor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.52,0:45:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,快集合军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gather the men to formation!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.97,0:45:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,叫醒他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Awake the men!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.98,0:45:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.39,0:45:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,看到信号了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The signal!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.53,0:45:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的医师死哪儿去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where the fuck is the medicus?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.72,0:45:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他进城了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He had gone to town,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.78,0:45:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,谁料到孩子这么早出生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the child not expected for weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.78,0:45:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我派卫兵去找他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have sent the guards to fetch him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.74,0:45:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉不太对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Something is wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.45,0:45:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,小家伙在抓我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It claws at me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.76,0:45:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好像不愿意离开子宫 在这里降生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}not wanting to leave womb to be born in this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.79,0:46:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我去找东西帮你止痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will find something to ease the pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.12,0:46:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,别离开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not leave me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.58,0:46:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我会回来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Know that I will return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.66,0:46:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,和你一同见证诸神的赐福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And together we will see this blessing into the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.52,0:46:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,再来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Again!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.86,0:46:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这里需要支援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I need help over here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.15,0:46:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,把弹药搬走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Relocate ammunition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.15,0:46:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,保持阵型前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Advance on rear position!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.07,0:46:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,胆敢阻拦的人 全都杀无赦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kill anyone in who stands in your path!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.44,0:46:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Halt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.58,0:47:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,杀个痛快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A glorious death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.85,0:47:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,杀掉他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kill them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.82,0:48:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我好像听到了尖叫声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought I heard a cry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.77,0:48:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你做了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What have you done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.33,0:48:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,一直以来想做的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What was always intended,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.12,0:48:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,消除这间宅子蒙受的诅咒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to see curse upon this house lifted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.93,0:48:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人阻碍我们俩了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No one left to come between us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.99,0:49:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,撤退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fall back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.78,0:49:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,撤退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fall back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.97,0:49:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,撤退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fall back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.05,0:49:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,一鼓作气 胜利是我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Press advantage! And see victory ours!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.28,0:49:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.44,0:49:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.04,0:49:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是朋友 不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are friends, are we not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.05,0:49:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,闺中密友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The very best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.36,0:49:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,那你为什么要做这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then why would you do this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.46,0:49:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要夺去我和孩子的生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why would you take my life and that of my child?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.75,0:49:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your child?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.33,0:49:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你不过是工具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are but a vessel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.53,0:49:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,承载着诸神赐予巴蒂塔斯家族的厚礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Carrying a gift from the gods to the House of Batiatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.10,0:50:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.03,0:50:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以打开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us see it unwrapped...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.94,0:50:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这是还给你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I owe you pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.11,0:51:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,奥诺玛默斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oenomaus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.82,0:51:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,奥诺玛默斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oenomaus...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.51,0:51:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我要回到妻子的怀抱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I go to my wife's arms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.68,0:51:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟 我们在另一个世界等着你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We shall greet you in the afterlife, my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.24,0:52:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,四处警戒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Secure the perimeter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.97,0:52:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,号令全军防御此地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Signal all men to defend this position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.88,0:52:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,各就各位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mark your stations!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.32,0:52:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,罗马战士做好准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Romans ready!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.52,0:52:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,露迪雅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lucretiaaaaaaa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.81,0:53:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,小宝贝 别哭了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hush now little one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.94,0:53:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are safe now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.36,0:53:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,有人爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are loved,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.43,0:53:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,直到永远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and shall be forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.28,0:54:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.82,0:54:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,昆图斯一直想要个儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Quintus always wanted a son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.15,0:54:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,多亏了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because of you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.82,0:55:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们终于能实现愿望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we shall have one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.51,0:55:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.66,0:56:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我绝不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will not die{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.63,0:56:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,死在奴隶的手里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}at the hands of a fucking slave!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.85,0:56:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我是自由人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am a free man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.96,0:56:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这个罗马人总算搞清楚了他的地位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Roman finally learns his place before us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.66,0:56:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,跪在我们面前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On his knees!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.80,0:57:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本没赢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You've won nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.59,0:57:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,罗马即将派出大军为我报仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Rome will send legions in my wake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.27,0:57:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,终有一天 你们会死无葬身之地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And one day soon you shall fall to deserved end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.60,0:57:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.61,0:57:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,但绝不是今天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet it is not this day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.92,0:58:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,罗马大军尽管来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let Rome send their legions!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.23,0:58:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们迎接挑战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We will face them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.25,0:58:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,要他们全都步葛雷博的后尘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And see all follow Glaber in death!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.22,0:58:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.45,0:58:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就要成为一支军队了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now we will become an army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.87,0:59:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.51,0:59:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯 斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus! Spartacus! Spartacus! Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.63,0:59:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯 斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus! Spartacus! Spartacus! Spartacus!{\r}
